            <ArticleTitle>IgE-mediated asthma: New revelations and future insights.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>128-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.rmed.2015.10.013</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0954-6111(15)30077-9</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The central role of IgE in the pathogenesis of allergic asthma has been well established; recent research has brought to light further interesting findings regarding the effects of IgE and anti-IgE therapy. This symposium explored these recent revelations and provided new insights into the importance of IgE in allergic asthma.</AbstractText>
